      "description": "Quiet header links with underline interaction.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Example navigation\"><a href=\"#how-it-works\">How it works</a><a href=\"https://github.com/Blasted-ctrl/Veritas\">GitHub <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:Hanken,Arial,sans-serif;display:flex;gap:32px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink,#203b34)}.ds-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#416b4b);outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:720px){.ds-nav{gap:16px}.ds-nav a:not(:last-child){display:none}.ds-nav a:last-child{font-size:12px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Analysis panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Flat clipped surface for upload or the adjacent source and assessment.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><header><h2>Inspect your media</h2><span>Model ready</span></header><p>Choose a file to begin.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:Hanken,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--surface,#fafbf8);color:var(--ink,#203b34);border:1px solid var(--line,#c9d2c8);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}.ds-panel header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:24px 28px}.ds-panel h2{margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.015em}.ds-panel span{font-size:12px;color:var(--quiet,#5c6c61)}.ds-panel p{margin:0;padding:0 28px 24px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted,#52635b)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-panel{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}",
      "refersTo": "analysis-panel"
    },
    {
      "name": "Upload target",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "Static prompt with the real native file input; drag handling belongs to the application.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-upload\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 17v4h16v-4M7 9l5-5 5 5M12 4v12\"/></svg><h3>Drop your file here</h3><p>Or choose one from your device</p><label class=\"ds-file-button\">Choose a file<input type=\"file\" aria-label=\"Choose a file\" /></label></div>",
      "css": ".ds-upload{font-family:Hanken,Arial,sans-serif;padding:30px 16px 23px;border:1px dashed var(--quiet,#5c6c61);border-radius:12px;text-align:center;color:var(--ink,#203b34);background:var(--surface,#fafbf8)}.ds-upload>svg{color:var(--accent,#416b4b)}.ds-upload h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:18px 0 0}.ds-upload p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted,#52635b);margin:7px 0 20px}.ds-file-button{font-family:Hanken,Arial,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:24px;min-height:46px;padding:10px 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.6;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms ease-out,color 120ms ease-out,transform 120ms ease-out;position:relative;background:var(--accent,#416b4b);color:var(--accent-ink,#fafbf8)}.ds-file-button input{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;opacity:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-file-button:hover{filter:brightness(.92)}.ds-file-button:focus-within{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#416b4b);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-file-button:active{transform:translateY(1px)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-file-button,.ds-upload{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}",
      "refersTo": "upload-area"
    },
    {
      "name": "Assessment score",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Illustrative class score; this preview is not a detector result.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-assessment\"><h3>Likely AI-generated</h3><p>The model’s prediction for this file. This does not establish authenticity.</p><div class=\"ds-score-label\"><span>AI-generated score</span><strong>72.0<small>%</small></strong></div><div class=\"ds-score-track\" role=\"meter\" aria-label=\"Illustrative AI-generated model score\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"72\"><span></span><i></i></div><p class=\"ds-score-note\">Illustrative class score, not a calibrated probability. Decision threshold: 50%.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-assessment{font-family:Hanken,Arial,sans-serif;padding:28px;background:var(--surface,#fafbf8);color:var(--ink,#203b34)}.ds-assessment h3{margin:0;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-assessment p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#52635b);line-height:1.6;margin:12px 0 0;max-width:45ch}.ds-score-label{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-top:26px;font-size:14px}.ds-score-label strong{font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-score-label small{font-size:17px;margin-left:2px}.ds-score-track{height:8px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--surface-2,#e2e8df);margin-top:12px;position:relative}.ds-score-track>span{display:block;background:var(--accent,#416b4b);height:100%;border-radius:4px;width:72%}.ds-score-track i{position:absolute;top:-4px;height:16px;width:1px;left:50%;background:var(--quiet,#5c6c61)}.ds-assessment .ds-score-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--quiet,#5c6c61)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-assessment,.ds-score-label,.ds-score-note,.ds-score-track{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Conservation study",
    "overview": "Historical design snapshot from November 1, 2026. The product page was redesigned on November 2. Current design decisions are recorded in docs/design/product-redesign.md, and current tokens live in frontend/src/app/globals.css. The components and values below document the earlier conservation-study direction.\n\nConservation study gives Veritas a calm, precise visual identity: cool green grounds, deep ink, open grotesk lettering, and flat panels. Hierarchy comes from type, spacing, fine rules, and restrained changes in tone. Real media and readable evidence carry the visual interest.\n\nThis document records the production website in `frontend/src/app/globals.css`, `page.tsx`, `layout.tsx`, and `components/VerdictCard.tsx`. The separate illustrative Hue kit at `design/veritas-design` is a reference artifact; its examples do not override the website tokens recorded here.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cool green tonal surfaces in light and dark themes.",
      "Hanken Grotesk with compact headings and plain sentence-case controls.",
      "Flat panels, thin separators, and Tabler outline icons.",
      "Evidence, class scores, and their limits remain readable together."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Theme Rule",
        "body": "Use the semantic CSS properties for both themes; warning, error, and focus retain their roles when the palette changes.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "Separate surfaces with tone and fine borders. The production interface uses no box shadows.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the production semantic properties so light and dark themes retain the same hierarchy.",
      "Do keep real media visually prominent and place the model assessment beside it on desktop, then below it on mobile.",
      "Do present a class score with its threshold, model identity, and visible limits.",
      "Do use Tabler outline icons with the production stroke weight and preserve visible keyboard focus."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't substitute the illustrative Hue kit's example styles for production CSS.",
      "Don't turn a model score into an authenticity seal or a calibrated probability claim.",
      "Don't introduce decorative shadows or motion that changes the quiet, flat surface language.",
      "Don't hide unavailable analysis behind a positive-looking result."
    ]
  }
}
